 "brief_summary": "This trial is conducted in Europe, Asia and South America. A one-year clinical trial to compare the safety of inhaled human insulin to subcutaneous insulin aspart in subjects with type 1 or type 2 diabetes and chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD).",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease\n* Type 1 or type 2 diabetes\n* HbA1c lower or equal to 11.0 %\n* Body Mass Index (BMI) lower or equal to 40.0 kg/m2\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Recurrent severe hypoglycaemia\n* Current smoking or smoking within the last 6 months\n* Other pulmonary disease including asthma\n* Proliferative retinopathy or maculopathy requiring acute treatment",
